            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention concerns a decision support system comprising:- a calculator (204) segmenting a battlefield environment into several layers, the battlefield environment being an environment in which a reference entity is to be protected with respect to a plurality of entities by using actable deterrent systems,- an obtaining unit (202) obtaining data representative of a position of said entity with respect to the layers and data representative of the probability that the deterrent system deters an entity,the calculator (204) providing, for each entity, the level of threat of said entity, computing a cost function for determining the deterrent systems to be engaged by the reference entity for rendering extremal the cost function, the cost function being a function depending from the provided level of threat and the obtained data, and generating tactical recommendations in association with the determined deterrent systems to be engaged.</p>
            </abstract>
